}}'''Envy''' was an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[Chroma Box]]. Envy was soon deleted from the game after [[Nikilis]] redesigned the [[Chroma Box]] into the [[Rainbow Box]].

==Appearance==
Its blade and guard are lime green, and the handle is solid black.

==Trivia==
*Its original design was [[LMFAO (Knife)|LMFAO]].
*This, along with the other knives from the [[Chroma Box]], was removed from all players’ [[Inventory|inventories]].
